[
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:09.120",
        "end_time": "00:00:15.120",
        "text": "Do you know this guy?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:12.000",
        "end_time": "00:00:18.640",
        "text": "I know what you're talking about, dude."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:15.120",
        "end_time": "00:00:22.119",
        "text": "Hey, what? Get off of me. What is wrong"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:18.640",
        "end_time": "00:00:30.439",
        "text": "with you, You have the wrong guy. Does he look"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:26.000",
        "end_time": "00:00:30.439",
        "text": "like he can fight? Come on, bro."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:38.160",
        "end_time": "00:00:46.859",
        "text": "You okay?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:54.559",
        "end_time": "00:00:58.879",
        "text": "Yo, what up y'all? It's your boy Clev"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:56.719",
        "end_time": "00:01:00.559",
        "text": "coming at you live on the bus. I"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:00:58.879",
        "end_time": "00:01:02.399",
        "text": "actually did take a little bit of"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:00.559",
        "end_time": "00:01:07.080",
        "text": "martial arts as a youth, so I'm going to"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:02.399",
        "end_time": "00:01:07.080",
        "text": "try and grade this fight as we're going."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:18.720",
        "end_time": "00:01:24.759",
        "text": "Holy Who are you?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:37.520",
        "end_time": "00:01:42.640",
        "text": "You got this, bro."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:01:42.640",
        "end_time": "00:01:45.960",
        "text": "My bad."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:11.760",
        "end_time": "00:02:16.080",
        "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:14.560",
        "end_time": "00:02:19.720",
        "text": "What the hell's going on? You really"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:16.080",
        "end_time": "00:02:19.720",
        "text": "want to talk about this now?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:24.239",
        "end_time": "00:02:28.000",
        "text": "Bus driver is down. I'm not going to"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:26.480",
        "end_time": "00:02:32.040",
        "text": "handle this. Every time I've tried to"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:28.000",
        "end_time": "00:02:32.040",
        "text": "drive a bus, I get yelled at."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:02:49.519",
        "end_time": "00:03:06.760",
        "text": "Go, you freak. Heat. Heat. Heat."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:43.040",
        "end_time": "00:03:47.000",
        "text": "Open the door, please."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:48.239",
        "end_time": "00:03:55.400",
        "text": "The back is about to go on my signal."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:03:50.720",
        "end_time": "00:03:55.400",
        "text": "Make a hard right. What signal?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:22.479",
        "end_time": "00:04:26.520",
        "text": "Everybody to the front now."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:27.520",
        "end_time": "00:04:32.280",
        "text": "What's up, y'all? What's up, y'all?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:28.560",
        "end_time": "00:04:32.280",
        "text": "What's up, y'all? What's up, y'all?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:40.960",
        "end_time": "00:04:45.560",
        "text": "You and your sister deserve what's"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:04:42.560",
        "end_time": "00:04:45.560",
        "text": "coming."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:08.240",
        "end_time": "00:05:13.479",
        "text": "Hold on everybody."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:10.479",
        "end_time": "00:05:13.479",
        "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:35.160",
        "end_time": "00:05:40.639",
        "text": "Sorry. We make a good team."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:40.639",
        "end_time": "00:05:48.759",
        "text": "Throughout my life, the 10 rings gave our family"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:45.759",
        "end_time": "00:05:48.759",
        "text": "power."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:50.080",
        "end_time": "00:05:54.800",
        "text": "If you want them to be yours one day,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:53.120",
        "end_time": "00:05:58.600",
        "text": "you have to show me you are strong"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:05:54.800",
        "end_time": "00:05:58.600",
        "text": "enough to carry them."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:00.800",
        "end_time": "00:06:07.680",
        "text": "You are a product of all who came before"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:03.720",
        "end_time": "00:06:10.600",
        "text": "you. The legacy of your family. You are"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:07.680",
        "end_time": "00:06:15.800",
        "text": "your mother. And whether you like it or"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:10.600",
        "end_time": "00:06:15.800",
        "text": "not, you are also your father."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:18.479",
        "end_time": "00:06:25.639",
        "text": "I told my men they wouldn't be able to"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:21.600",
        "end_time": "00:06:25.639",
        "text": "kill you if they tried."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:31.840",
        "end_time": "00:06:40.280",
        "text": "Glenn, I was right. You're just a"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:37.880",
        "end_time": "00:06:45.759",
        "text": "criminal who murders people. Be careful how you speak to me,"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:43.039",
        "end_time": "00:06:45.759",
        "text": "boy."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:46.400",
        "end_time": "00:06:49.400",
        "text": "ladies."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:50.880",
        "end_time": "00:06:56.240",
        "text": "I thought I could change my"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:52.759",
        "end_time": "00:07:02.880",
        "text": "name, start a new life, but I could"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:06:59.240",
        "end_time": "00:07:13.000",
        "text": "never escape his shadow. My"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:07.639",
        "end_time": "00:07:13.000",
        "text": "son, you can't run from your past."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:17.120",
        "end_time": "00:07:20.840",
        "text": "Is this what you wanted?"
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:28.240",
        "end_time": "00:07:31.800",
        "text": "You got this."
    },
    {
        "start_time": "00:07:32.720",
        "end_time": "00:07:35.960",
        "text": "Thank you."
    }
]